{
  "Format": "Ahziael overlay add-on",
  "Name": "Bot Players",
  "Author": "Niduus",
  "Description": "Buttons for the Bot Players test: call a bot next to you, have it join your battle, kick it from your battle, send it away, and list the bots out. Bot Players must be on (Game Rules > Battles and World).",
